OL,3,GNEWSAAccused says he 'had nothing to
OL,4,Ado' with murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a
OL,7,F71-year-old has told a court he had
OL,8,F"nothing to do with his death," as he
OL,9,Fbegan giving evidence in his defence.
OL,11,FProsecutors allege John Mills, 46, beat
OL,12,FJohn Boyle to death as he lay in bed at
OL,13,Fhis flat in Leatherland Court,
OL,14,FKettering, Northamptonshire, on 26
OL,15,FOctober 2025.
OL,17,FTaking to the witness stand at
OL,18,FNorthampton Crown Court, Mills
OL,19,Frepeatedly denied killing the
OL,20,Fgrandfather, being present at the time
OL,21,Fof his death or knowing who was
OL,22,Fresponsible.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
