OL,3,GNEWSAAccused says he 'had nothing to
OL,4,Ado' with murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FMills said acquaintances had invited
OL,7,Fhim to Boyle's flat on two previous
OL,8,Foccasions and described him as a "nice
OL,9,Fchap" who seemed "vulnerable".
